  "category": "technical",
  "reply": "I understand you need Chorus Pro support for French public-sector invoicing by January. According to our current roadmap, Italy's SDI and France's Chorus Pro are on the roadmap with no committed date. Our support policy explicitly states that we must not promise a release date for unreleased features. I cannot provide a timeline or guarantee that Chorus Pro will be available by January. For the most up-to-date information on feature releases, you can check our ideas portal at ideas.ledgerly.example where feature requests are collected. If you have an Enterprise plan, you could discuss this with your named customer success manager, but even then, no dates can be promised. Is there anything else I can help you with regarding your current invoicing setup?",
  "sources": ["invoicing", "support"],
